Z||000029||87ECO5||01-02-2001||10:13 AM||||Is it too cliche to use the "snowball rolling down a hill" analogy?<P>I've got Paul McKibben performing test runs on 3" by 3" logos <I>ONLY</I> (no "PFF" added).  <B>Jackalrr</B> and <B>sombre</B> have offered their services and are already delivering decals to some customers (have I missed anyone else?).  Some folks want the "PFF", others want their "handles", still others want a plain logo.  Do you see where I'm going here?<P>Does anyone else feel that we need to pull on the reins?  Does it matter to anyone that we will not have consistency?||||reg||1
